    "id": "post:masterpost:story:ST-8:0",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Jo Sikhate hain",
    "body": "**Maine** **Notice** kiya hai \u2014\n\njo log **Sabse** **Confidently** doosron ko advice dete hain \u2014\n\n\u2013woh **Usually** usi **Cheez** ke baare mein hoti hai\n\n\u2013**Jisme** unhe khud **Struggle** hai.\n\n**Hypocrisy** nahi.\n\nYeh hota hai \u2014 hum woh **Sikhate** hain jo hume khud **Sikhna** hai.\n\nJo **Sawaal** **Sabse** zyada alive hai tumhare andar \u2014\n\n\u2013wahi **Cheez** **Tumse** emerge hoti hai bahar bhi.\n\n**Mainne** **Saalon** tak emotional patterns ke baare mein sikhaya.\n\n\u2013Aur **Saalon** tak khud se **Disconnected** raha.\n\nWoh ek **Contradiction** tha.\n\n\u2013Woh ek **Signal** bhi tha.\n\n**Tumhare** **Andar** kaunsa sawaal abhi sabse zyada alive hai?\n\n\u2013Wahi **Shayad** woh **Cheez** hai jo tumhe dhundhni hai \u2014\n\n\u2013**Sikhni** bhi, **Dekhni** bhi.",
