    "id": "post:draft:masterpost:hottakes:HT-2:0",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "draft:masterpost:hottakes:HT-2:0",
    "body": "Tumhara overthinking sirf anxiety nahi bhi ho sakta.\n\nKabhi kabhi yeh unresolved Attachment Pattern hota hai\njo certainty dhoondh raha hota hai\njo kabhi mili hi nahi.\n\nAnxious Attachment ek aisa mind banata hai\njo scan karna band nahi kar sakta.\n\nMessages analyze.\nTone decode.\nConversation rehearse.\nWorst case imagine.\n\nKyuki ek time tha\njab uncertainty ka matlab tha \u2014\nkoi ja raha hai.\n\nAb present mein threat nahi hota,\npar body past ke rule se react karti hai.\n\nBahaar se yeh overthinking lagta hai.\nAndar se yeh guard duty hoti hai.\n\nTumhara mind defective nahi.\nTumhara system abhi bhi emergency ke liye prepared hai\njo shayad ab aa nahi rahi.\n\nHealing ka kaam thought band karna nahi.\nSystem ko enough safety dena hai\nki woh scanning duty se retire ho sake.",
    "pillar": "",
    "status": "saved",
