    "id": "post:post:launchos_1022",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Seedha Bol Deta hoon. Jo Log yahan Aate hain \u2014 jo Questions Poochte hain, jo",
    "body": "**Seedha Bol Deta hoon.** Jo Log yahan Aate hain \u2014 jo Questions Poochte hain, jo Share karte hain, jo Save karte hain \u2014 Tumhara Shukriya.\n\nYeh Space Banata nahi Kisi Account ke Liye.\nYeh Banata hai Isiliye ki kuch Cheezein clearly Bolne ki Zaroorat thi.\nJo Mujhe Took Years to See \u2014 Shayad Kisi ko Aaj Kaam Aaye.\n\nShukriya us Trust ke Liye jo yeh Hone Deta hai.\n\n**CTA / ending** Use as Genuine gratitude post",
