    "id": "post:post:masterpost:marketing:AD-8:1",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Honest Hona **Chahta** hoon:",
    "body": "**Honest** Hona **Chahta** hoon:\n\nmain ab 2.0 ko Zyada Expensive Banane Wala hoon \u2014 jaise Structure Tight hogi, Delivery Better hogi.\n\nAbhi **Founding** **Batch** mein ek Tradeoff hai \u2014 Price Lowest hai, lekin Tumhe Mujh par Bharosa karna hai ki main Deliver Karunga.\n\nKuch Logon Ne Pehle Batches mein yeh Kiya. Aur unka Response Mujhe yahan Tak Le Aaya.\n\nJo **Founding** **Batch** mein Join karte hain woh Paate hain:\n\n\u2013\u2014 **Lowest** **Price** Guarantee \u2014 Hamesha ke Liye\n\n\u2013\u2014 Direct access jo Future Batches mein Possible Na ho\n\n\u2013\u2014 ek **Group** jo **Genuinely** Committed ho\n\nagar **Genuinely** **Consider** kar Rahe ho \u2014 Aaj Decide karo. Kyunki Next Batch ka matlab hai Next Price aur Next Window.\n\nLink Bio mein hai.",
