    "id": "post:mm-dm_triggers-3",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Ek sawaal \u2014 abhi honestly jawab do",
    "body": "Abhi, honestly \u2014 mujhe bhi khud se yeh poochna pada tha: kya chahiye zyada \u2014 aur cheezein samajhna jo already hoti hain, ya jo samajh aaya hai usse actually jeena?\n\nYeh poll nahi hai. Yeh woh sawaal hai jo bahut log andar se pehle se poochh rahe hain.\n\nKyunki agar jawab 'jeena' hai \u2014 toh woh gap jo awareness ke baad bhi feel hoti hai, woh normal hai. Aur woh specific gap content se close nahi hoti.\n\nContent se recognition milti hai. Structure se integration. Psychology pattern ko naam deti hai, nervous system response ko andar se address karta hai, Vedanta us layer ko question karta hai jo baaki sab ke neeche hai.\n\nTeeno ko saath laana hi point hai. Aur woh space AB 2.0 mein hi banta hai. Agar woh jawab tumhara bhi tha \u2014 DM karo, baat karte hain.",
