    "id": "post:apple:pain:intoxication-mind",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Nasha Enjoyable Nahi Lagta \u2014 Woh Hosh Door Kar Deta Hai",
    "body": "Shaam ke saat baje. Din bhar kaam, ek pal sukoon nahi. Phone uthaya \u2014 scroll. Ya ek drink. Ya Netflix khud chal pada.\n\nHum bolte hain relax ke liye. Sach mein?\n\nWoh hosh ko thoda door kar deta hai. Aur hosh \u2014 woh andar ka lagataar shor, planning, worry, wahi soch baar baar \u2014 woh thaka deta hai.\n\nNasha, scroll, distraction \u2014 sab ek hi kaam karte hain. Kuch minute ke liye shor band. Body ko thodi raahat.\n\nIsiliye 'bas band kar do' kaam nahi karta. Shor abhi bhi wahin hai. Aur jab tak shor hai, koi na koi cheez usse dabati rahegi.\n\nAsli kaam \u2014 woh shor aata kahaan se hai. Kya tha jise dabana pada?",
