    "id": "post:exp16:postpurchase:community-reflection-prompt",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Jo Cheez Naam Paati Hai \u2014 Woh Kam Darawni Ho Jaati Hai",
    "body": "Ek observation share karo iss hafte ka \u2014 sirf ek line mein.\n\nKuch bhi: koi pattern jo baar-baar aaya. Ek pal jab tumne apne aap ko bahar se dekha. Koi cheez jo thodi alag feel hui \u2014 chahe samajh na aaya kyun.\n\nKoi right answer nahi. Koi comparison nahi.\n\nYeh isliye nahi ki main ek list banaun. Yeh isliye ki naam dena ek genuine mechanism hai \u2014 jo cheez naam paati hai, woh thodi kam darawni ho jaati hai. Jo andar bina lafz ke atki rehti hai, woh body mein reh jaati hai. Bahar likhna ek chhoti si release hai.\n\nMain khud jab tak likh na doon, ek khayaal 2 baje raat tak dimag mein ghoomta rehta hai. Likhte hi utar jaata hai.\n\nComment mein likho agar comfortable ho \u2014 main padhta hoon.",
