    "id": "post:masterpost:sales:DM-1:1",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "DM Trigger \u2014 SYSTEM",
    "body": "TRIGGER: \"SYSTEM\"\n\nHey.\n\n'Sab samajhta hoon phir bhi wahi hota hai' \u2014 yeh sirf frustration nahi hai. Yeh ek specific gap hai. Samajhne aur alag react karne ke beech woh 2 second ka space \u2014 wahi kaam nahi kar raha.\n\nInformation ki kami nahi hai tumhare paas. Tumhe pata hai kya hota hai, kyun hota hai. Phir bhi body pehle faisla le leti hai \u2014 chest tight, jaw clench \u2014 aur tab tak react ho chuka hota hai jab tak dimag 'ruk' sochta bhi nahi.\n\nMain khud yahin phasa raha saalon. Ek comment se pura din girta tha, jaante hue bhi.\n\nAB 2.0 mein wahi space train hota hai \u2014 body-level regulation, pattern interrupt, real-time awareness. Sirf theory nahi.\n\nAgar sach mein curious ho \u2014 ek cheez batao: woh specific pattern kya hai jo loop mein hai? Kab se hai?\n\nKoi pitch nahi. Bas dekhna hai tumhare liye relevant hai ya nahi.",
