    "id": "post:exp15:dm:cart-close-whatsapp",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Cart Close Aaj \u2014 Jo Rok Raha Hai, Woh Bolo",
    "body": "WHATSAPP BROADCAST \u2014 Cart Close Day\n\nAaj AB band ho raha hai. Main pressure nahi banana chahta \u2014 toh seedha bolunga.\n\nJis cheez ne abhi tak roka \u2014 woh jo bhi hai \u2014 woh familiar hai. Yeh pehli baar nahi jo usne tumhe roka.\n\nMechanism: avoidance pattern kisi ek course se nahi banta. Woh pehle se hota hai. Aur wahi pattern abhi bhi decide kar raha hai \u2014 'baad mein', 'sahi time aayega', 'thoda aur soch loon'.\n\nReframe: yeh course join karne ka decision nahi hai. Yeh us pattern ko ek baar notice karne ka decision hai.\n\nLena hai \u2014 link bio mein hai.\nNahi \u2014 waitlist ke liye reply karo: NEXT.\nGenuine confusion hai \u2014 reply karo, baat karte hain.\n\nJo bhi decide karo \u2014 apni terms pe karo.",
    "pillar": "Engagement / DM / Interaction Prompt",
    "status": "draft",
