    "id": "post:exp15:dm:keyword-safe-trigger",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "DM Karo SAFE \u2014 Agar Yeh Tumhara Andar Ka Sach Hai",
    "body": "Ek feeling describe karta hoon \u2014 dekho pehchaan mein aati hai kya.\n\nBahar se sab theek lag raha hai. Koi badi problem nahi. Phir bhi andar ek hissa wait kar raha hai \u2014 ki kab kuch galat hoga, ki yeh sukoon sirf thodi der ka hai.\n\nYa ek aur: bina kisi wajah ke, body mein ek halki si tightness baithi rehti hai. Jaise kuch suljha nahi. Koi khatra dikhta nahi \u2014 par body ne thaan rakha hai ki abhi relax nahi karna.\n\nYeh kamzori nahi hai. Yeh tumhara nervous system hai \u2014 jisne kisi purane waqt mein seekh liya ki duniya bharose ke layak safe nahi hai. Aur woh seekh ab bhi apne aap chalti rehti hai, chahe haalat ab alag ho.\n\nAgar yeh tumse mila \u2014 DM mein likho: SAFE.\n\nMain samjhaunga ki nervous system ke level pe ho kya raha hai, aur practically kya kaam aa sakta hai. Pehle koi pitch nahi. Sirf samajhna.",
    "pillar": "Engagement / DM / Interaction Prompt",
    "status": "draft",
