    "id": "post:exp15:dm:targeted-share-ask",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Ek Insaan Hai Tumhari Life Mein \u2014 Jo Patterns Se Thak Gaya Hai",
    "body": "Shayad woh baar baar kehta hai: 'main weak hoon, isliye yeh band nahi hota.'\n\nWoh moment \u2014 jab koi apni ongoing struggle ko apni character ki failure samajh leta hai \u2014 woh painful hota hai. Aur bilkul unnecessary.\n\nUnhe yeh post share karo.\n\nWoh weak nahi hain. Unka pattern unhe protect kar raha hai \u2014 ek purani strategy se, jo kisi waqt sach mein kaam aayi thi. Aaj bhi wahi strategy chal rahi hai kyunki body ko abhi tak koi safer option nahi mila.\n\nProtection ko blame karna healing nahi hai. Pehle samajhna padta hai woh protection kya bacha rahi hai.\n\nUnhe yeh pata chale. Kabhi kabhi ek line kaafi hoti hai \u2014 'yeh tumhari galti nahi, yeh tumhara pattern hai' \u2014 aur andar kuch shift hota hai.\n\nShare karo, agar koi mind mein aaya.",
