    "id": "post:exp15:dm:keyword-ready-trigger",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "READY \u2014 Sirf Tab Bhejo",
    "body": "Main sabko andar nahi ghaseetunga.\n\nAB 2.0 un logon ke liye hai jinke andar already ek line cross ho chuki hai \u2014 jahan sirf padh lena ab kaafi nahi lagta, kuch actually alag karna hai.\n\nAgar woh line tumne feel ki hai \u2014 DM karo: READY\nMain poori detail seedha bhejoonga. Price, structure, format, timeline \u2014 sab. Koi drama nahi.\n\nAur ek cheez utni hi honestly:\nAgar abhi 50 sawaal hain aur confidence nahi aa raha \u2014 woh bhi useful data hai, usse dismiss mat karo. Shayad abhi waqt nahi aaya. Aur woh bilkul theek hai.\n\nMaine khud 3 saal wait kiya tha wapas aane se pehle. Jaldi baazi mein kuch andar nahi jaata.\n\nREADY woh hain jinhone ek darwaza band hote \u2014 aur ek aur khulte \u2014 mehsoos kiya.",
