    "id": "post:exp15:dm:keyword-stuck-trigger",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Pattern Pata Hai \u2014 Phir Bhi Wahi Hota Hai",
    "body": "Yeh scene mujhe bhi bahut saalon tak pata tha:\n\nApna pattern naam se pata hai. Trigger bhi pata hai. Phir bhi wahi situation aati hai \u2014 aur main exactly wahi karta jo nahi karna tha.\n\nAur phir woh guilt: 'Main to jaanta tha. Phir bhi.'\n\nYeh awareness ka fail hona nahi hai.\nYeh sign hai ki awareness waali layer ka kaam ho gaya \u2014 usne tumhe dikha diya. Ab ek aur layer hai, jo sirf jaan lene se nahi khulti. Woh body mein hai, reaction ke andar hai.\n\nMaine yeh gap khud 450+ kitaabein padhne ke baad samjha \u2014 knowing aur shifting do alag jagah hain.\n\nAgar yeh scene tumhara hai \u2014 DM karo: STUCK\nKoi pitch nahi. Pehle sirf dekhte hain exactly kahan atke ho.",
