    "id": "post:arsenal_0967",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Pehli 5 Batches Mein Sirf Padha Hua Deta Tha. Jeeya Hua Nahi.",
    "body": "Seedha bolunga \u2014 AB 2.0, version 1 se kyun alag hai:\n\nPehli 5 batches mein jo main sikha raha tha, woh us waqt ka best tha. Par ek gap tha jo mujhe tab dikhta bhi nahi: main sirf padha hua de raha tha. Jeeya hua nahi.\n\nPhir 3 saal. Website utaari, saari sales release kar di, do saal kuch kamaya nahi. 450 se zyada kitaabein. Burnout \u2014 real wala, woh nahi jo productivity content mein romanticize hota hai. Woh phase jab samajh nahi aata tum kaun ho jab saare labels hat jaate hain.\n\nAb 2.0 mein woh depth hai.\n\nConcepts wahi \u2014 Vedanta aur psychology ka intersection. Par delivery badal gayi. Examples ab kitaab se nahi, apne experience se aate hain.\n\nEk fark jo students turant feel karte hain \u2014 ab main sikhata nahi, share karta hoon. Body jaanti hai jab koi genuinely us jagah se bol raha hai, aur jab sirf explain kar raha hai.",
