    "id": "post:plug_0910",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Dikh Bhi Raha Hai \u2014 Phir Bhi Rok Nahi Paate. Kyun?",
    "body": "Tum jaante ho yeh pattern hai. Har baar sochte ho is baar nahi karunga. Aur phir theek wahi ho jaata hai.\n\nWorst part \u2014 tum aware ho. Kabhi kabhi us moment mein saaf dikh bhi raha hota hai ki kya ho raha hai. Phir bhi haath nahi rok paate.\n\nYeh weakness nahi. Yeh ek specific cheez ka signal hai: pattern surface pe nahi baitha.\n\nJo upar ki layer pe hai \u2014 woh awareness se badal jaata hai. Jo deeper conditioning hai \u2014 woh nervous system mein hai, body mein hai. Usse awareness sirf acknowledge karti hai, badalti nahi.\n\nEk student ne mujhe likha tha: 'Mujhe pata hai main please karne ke liye yeh karta hoon. Par jab woh moment aata hai \u2014 pata chalne se pehle hi main kar chuka hota hoon.' Woh milliseconds ka gap \u2014 asli kaam wahin hota hai.\n\nAham Brahmasmi us root level pe kaam karta hai \u2014 samajh ke neeche wali layer pe, jahan zyada information kabhi pahunchti hi nahi.",
