    "id": "post:exp12:faq:ai-generic-content-objection",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Yeh AI Se Bana Generic Toh Nahi?",
    "body": "Fair sawaal \u2014 2026 mein: 'aajkal sab AI se banta hai. Yeh bhi wahi toh nahi?'\n\nSeedha jawab: AB ka source koi algorithm nahi tha. Source yeh tha \u2014\n\n5 live batches mein direct observation \u2014 kya baar baar aata hai students mein, week 1 mein kya atakta hai, week 3 mein kya shift hota hai.\n3+ saal ka andar ka kaam \u2014 450+ books padhi, phir woh cheezein floor pe actually jeeyin, jinka result theory se alag nikla.\n1000+ logon ke patterns \u2014 jo inbox mein, DMs mein, calls pe roz dikhte hain.\n\nUsme se kisi tak AI ki pahunch thi hi nahi.\n\nAI existing content se pattern match karta hai. Yeh course existing assumptions ka pattern break karta hai. Dono alag cheezein hain.\n\nMain AI tools use karta hoon \u2014 woh ek tool hai. Par source yeh hai: main, mere students, aur 3 saal ka silence.\n\nGeneric content batana easy hai \u2014 koi bhi de sakta hai. Woh dena mushkil hai jo actually jiya gaya ho.",
