    "id": "post:obj:already_know_psychology",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "'Main Already Jaanta Hoon' \u2014 Wahi Toh Problem",
    "body": "'Main psychology already bahut jaanta hoon.'\n\nMaanta hoon. Aur yahi sabse common trap hai.\n\nTum anxious attachment perfectly explain kar sakte ho. Fawn response, nervous system dysregulation \u2014 sab samajhte ho. Aur phir kuch ghante baad exactly wahi karte ho jo hamesha karte aaye ho.\n\nKyunki jaanna aur integrate karna do alag departments hain. Cortex ke paas concept hai \u2014 nervous system ke paas abhi bhi woh purana default. Dimaag ne samajh liya, body ko signal abhi nahi mila.\n\nAham Brahmasmi un logon ke liye nahi bana jo aur zyada knowledge chahte hain.\n\nWoh un ke liye bana hai jo bahut jaante hain \u2014 aur phir bhi loop mein hain. Kyunki woh ek alag problem hai. Aur uska ilaaj aur content nahi hai.",
