    "id": "post:obj:therapy_compatibility",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Therapy Chal Rahi Hai \u2014 Toh AB Kyun?",
    "body": "Therapy chal rahi hai \u2014 genuinely accha hai.\n\nMain khud years therapists ke paas gaya tha, aur woh mere liye kaam nahi kiya \u2014 par yeh unke against nahi, ek poori alag baat hai. Suno.\n\nTherapy mein tum past samajhte ho \u2014 pattern kahan se aaya, woh relationship woh feeling kyun laata tha. Woh khudai zaroori kaam karti hai.\n\nAB mein tum present mein alag respond karna seekhte ho \u2014 trigger aane ke baad kya karo, nervous system ko regulate kaise karo, us loop ko sach mein interrupt kaise karo.\n\nDono alag kaam hain. Ek doosre ki jagah nahi leta.\n\nAgar 6 mahine therapy ke baad bhi koi ek specific loop repeat ho raha hai \u2014 woh usually isliye ki understanding body tak nahi utri. Ya identity level tak nahi gayi, jahan behaviour sach mein badalta hai.\n\nWoh gap yahan address hota hai \u2014 therapy ke saath, uske against nahi.\n\nDono chalo \u2014 dono ek doosre ko strong karte hain.",
    "pillar": "FAQ / Objection / Doubt Handling",
