    "id": "post:obj:online_courses_dont_work",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "'Courses Kaam Nahi Karte' \u2014 Ek Baat Suno",
    "body": "'Online courses mere liye kaam nahi karte.'\n\nFair. Genuinely. Aur main ise seedha address karta hoon kyunki yeh dismiss karne layak nahi.\n\nZyadatar courses information dete hain \u2014 explanations, frameworks, 'how to' guides. Aur tum already bahut information le chuke ho. Shayad zaroorat se zyada. Problem information mein nahi hai \u2014 problem us ek step mein hai jo information aur actual change ke beech chhoot jaata hai.\n\nWoh step integration hai. Jab tak koi cheez body level pe integrate nahi hoti, woh inspired content rehti hai \u2014 tumhara experience nahi banti.\n\nAB isliye alag hai: woh information nahi, wiring pe kaam karta hai. Jab nervous system samajhta hai kyun specific situation trigger karti hai \u2014 kyun 'rationally sochne' ke baad bhi wahi hota hai \u2014 tab behaviour shift hona shuru hota hai.\n\nCourse ne fail nahi kiya. Format ne kiya \u2014 woh format jo sirf upar upar kaam karta hai.\n\nEk course na chale \u2014 woh data hai, sentence nahi.",
