    "id": "post:masterpost:sales:SP-9:0",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Objection Flip \u2014 'Abhi Sahi Time Nahi'",
    "body": "'Abhi sahi time nahi hai.'\n\nMain jaanta hoon yeh genuinely feel hota hai. Aur main isko dismiss nahi kar raha.\n\nPar ek cheez honestly share karta hoon: woh system jo 'abhi nahi' bol raha hai \u2014 wahi system hai jise change karna hai.\n\nMechanism yeh hai: nervous system ka primary kaam status quo maintain karna hai. Woh predictable prefer karta hai \u2014 chahe predictable dukh hi kyun na ho. Unknown ke liye energy lagana \u2014 woh threat feel hoti hai. Isliye jab bhi real change ka moment aata hai, woh system ek reason generate karta hai. 'Abhi busy hoon.' 'Thoda aur time.' 'Ek cheez settle ho jaaye pehle.'\n\nWoh reasons fake nahi hote. Par woh poori tasveer bhi nahi.\n\nSahi time ka wait karte karte log saalon nikaal dete hain. Isliye nahi ki woh lazy hain \u2014 isliye ki protective system convincing hota hai, aur woh abhi tak address nahi hua.\n\nAB 2.0 mein hum seedha us system ke saath kaam karte hain.\n\nEk honest sawaal: yeh kitne time se 'abhi sahi time nahi' hai?",
