    "id": "post:newgold:batch31:email:cart-close:07",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Cart Band \u2014 Tumne Miss Nahi Kiya",
    "body": "Enrollment band ho gaya. Batch 5 shuru ho raha hai.\n\nAgar tum andar nahi aaye \u2014 koi baat nahi. Genuinely.\n\nAur bataun kyun yeh performative nahi hai: jo kaam Aham Brahmasmi mein hota hai, woh tab chalta hai jab tum sach mein ready ho. Pressure se nahi. FOMO se nahi. Jab koi cheez andar se hilaati hai \u2014 tab.\n\nToh agar timing sahi nahi thi \u2014 woh honest information hai. Usse respect karo.\n\nTumne miss nahi kiya. Sirf abhi nahi.\n\nIs list pe raho, content pe raho. Jo feel ho, feel karo. Jab Batch 6 ki announcement aayegi \u2014 is list walon ko pehle pata chalega. Tab bhi koi urgency nahi banaunga.\n\nAgar tum Batch 5 mein aa gaye \u2014 welcome. Yeh kaam real hai. Tum sahi jagah ho. Pehla session [DATE] ko. Details alag se.\n\nDono ke liye \u2014 yahin hoon.\n\n\u2014 Tushar",
