    "id": "post:exp7:connection:rest-feels-illegal",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Kuch Nahi Karna Illegal Kyun Lagta Hai",
    "body": "Kal shaam sofe pe baith gaya. Phone side mein, koi kaam nahi. Do second mein andar se ek awaaz \u2014 'kuch productive karo, lazy ho raha hai tu.'\n\nAur physically chest tight ho gayi. Guilt hawa mein nahi, body mein tha.\n\nMujhe samajh aaya yeh ambition nahi hai. Mere ghar mein rest kabhi free nahi thi \u2014 kuch kiya nahi toh kuch ho nahi, yeh message deewaron mein tha. Toh body ne chupke se ek equation likh li: rest = danger.\n\nNervous system to-do list nahi padhta. Woh ek hi sawaal padhta hai \u2014 'main abhi safe hoon?' Aur khaali baithna us sawaal ka jawab nahi lagta.\n\nMaine ek cheez ki. 5 minute baitha. Guilt aaya. Usse fix nahi kiya, sirf dekha ki aaya hai. Doosre din thoda kam chubha. Body ko proof repeat se milta hai, ek din mein nahi.\n\nRest earn nahi hoti \u2014 rest maintenance hai. Illegal isliye lagti hai kyunki kisi ne kabhi bola hi nahi ki yeh legal hai.",
