    "id": "post:plug_0918",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Jo Genuinely Ready Hote Hain Unhe Push Nahi Chahiye Hota",
    "body": "Main course sell karta hoon. Yeh koi news nahi.\n\nAur honestly \u2014 main push nahi karna chahta.\n\nKyunki jo genuinely ready hote hain unhe push nahi chahiye hota. Woh pehle se ek specific jagah pe khade hote hain. Woh sawaal poochh rahe hote hain \u2014 sirf doosron se nahi, khud se:\n\n'Yeh pattern kab change hoga?' 'Main khud ke liye kab jiyunga?' 'Yeh baar baar repeat kyun hota hai \u2014 jaante hue bhi?'\n\nAgar woh sawaal tumhara hai \u2014 conversation shuru karte hain.\n\nAgar nahi \u2014 koi baat nahi. Content yahin rehta hai.\n\nMere liye sabse important yeh hai: jab koi AB karta hai kyunki woh genuinely wahan hai \u2014 woh zyada actually kaam karta hai. Kyunki woh push se nahi, pull se aaya hai.\n\nAur woh difference result mein dikhta hai.",
