    "id": "post:stories:dm-trigger:ab20-info",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Pehle batata hoon yeh kya NAHI hai",
    "body": "Aham Brahmasmi 2.0 \u2014 paanchva batch.\n\nPehle yeh saaf: yeh woh content course nahi jahan tum dekho, notes lo, aur bhool jao.\n\nYeh un logon ke liye hai jo pehle se bahut kuch samajhte hain \u2014 aur phir bhi wahi patterns laut aate hain. Jahan sirf dimaag ki clarity kaam nahi karti. Jahan body kuch aur hi taraf kheench leti hai.\n\nIsi liye Psychology, Vedanta aur Nervous System teeno saath aate hain \u2014 akela koi ek poora kaam nahi karta.\n\nSeats limited hain, [LAUNCH DATE] se khulti hain.\n\nAgar sach mein jaanna hai \u2014 yeh kya hai, kaise chalta hai, tumhare liye theek hai ya nahi \u2014 DM karo: AB20. Main khud reply karta hoon. Seedhi baat.",
