    "id": "post:stories:dm-trigger:free-resource",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Willpower ka masla hai hi nahi",
    "body": "Ek aam si baat: tum thaan lete ho ki ab badalna hai. Sach mein thaan lete ho. Phir kuch din mein wahi purana chakkar. Aur tum sochte ho \u2014 'main badal kyun nahi paata.'\n\nIsme tum akele nahi ho. Aur yeh willpower ka masla hai hi nahi.\n\nWoh patterns jaan-boojh ke nahi aate \u2014 yeh nervous system ke purane bachaav hain. Kabhi kaam ke the, ab apne aap chalte rehte hain. Naam pata ho toh inse nipatna aasaan ho jaata hai.\n\nIsi liye ek free cheez share kar raha hoon \u2014 '5 Patterns Jo Change Ko Rok Dete Hain.' Psychology aur Vedanta dono lens se. Chhoti, practical, koi bharti nahi.\n\nReply karo: PATTERNS. Main seedha PDF bhej deta hoon.",
