    "id": "post:stories:launch:cart-close",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "'Decide nahi kar paaye' \u2014 sach mein?",
    "body": "Slide 1:\nAaj raat AB 2.0 close ho raha hai. Aur kyun close hota hai \u2014 unlimited open nahi rehta: capped group ke saath hi actual depth tak jaana possible hai. Isi liye pehle batch ki 50 seats bhi cap karni padi thi.\n\n---\nSlide 2:\nJo join kar chuke \u2014 welcome. Main is batch ke liye genuinely excited hoon. Andar se.\n\n---\nSlide 3:\nEk reframe: jo log 'decide nahi kar paaye' \u2014 woh aksar decide kar chuke hote hain. Andar se. Bas permission dhundh rahe hote hain.\n\nAgar koi specific cheez rok rahi hai \u2014 DM karo. Seedhi baat karte hain.\n\n---\nSlide 4:\nJo is baar nahi kar paaye \u2014 koi pressure nahi. Aur jo cheez andar chal rahi hai, woh kahin nahi jaati. Jab ready ho, yahan hoon.\nNext batch waitlist: DM karo NEXT.",
