    "id": "post:stories:launch:last-24-hours",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Jo cheez rokti hai \u2014 wahi cheez badalni hai",
    "body": "Slide 1:\nKal tak door band ho jaayega.\n\n---\nSlide 2:\nAham Brahmasmi 2.0 kal [TIME] pe close ho raha hai. Yeh last reminder hai \u2014 koi aur nahi aayega.\n\n---\nSlide 3:\nMain jaanta hoon kuch log hain jinka andar 'haan' keh raha hai \u2014 par kuch rok raha hai.\n\nAur yahi irony hai: woh 'kuch' exactly wahi pattern hai jo change karna hai. Jo cheez bheetar se rokti hai \u2014 wahi cheez address karni hai.\n\nGenuinely confusion hai? DM karo. Main personally baat karta hoon.\n\n---\nSlide 4:\nInke baad next batch ka koi timeline nahi. Yeh woh window hai \u2014 aur windows permanently open nahi rehti.",
