    "id": "post:stories:launch:urgency-seats",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "'Kal dekhenge' koi faisla nahi hai",
    "body": "Seedha: AB 2.0 mein [X] seats baaki hain. Waitlist se jo aaye, woh already bhar gaye.\n\nEk cheez saaf: main false countdown nahi karta. Jab seats bharte hain, cart band hota hai \u2014 bas. Main khud nahi jaanta kitna waqt bacha hai. Yeh urgency manufactured nahi, simply math hai.\n\nAur ek reframe: 'kal dekhenge' koi faisla nahi hai. Yeh deferral hai. Aur deferral ka matlab \u2014 woh sawaal jo actually decide kar raha hai, 'kya yeh mujhpe apply hota hai', woh abhi bhi anpoochha hai.\n\nUs sawaal ka jawab aaj nahi badlega kal.\n\nAgar honest jawab 'haan' hai \u2014 link bio mein.",
