    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Sabko please karna ek survival mode hai",
    "body": "Sabko khush rakhna survival mode hai.\n\nKisi ne mujhe sikhaya nahi \u2014 maine yeh tab seekha jab apna asli reaction dikhana kahin safe nahi raha.\n\nWoh sabse pehla kamra kaunsa tha \u2014 soch ke dekho.",
