    "id": "post:clbal:9:26",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Meri khamoshi mera jawab hai",
    "body": "Main chup ho jaata hoon, aur log usse kamzori samajh lete hain.\n\nWoh kamzori nahi \u2014 woh samajh hai jo jaanti hai ki kuch baatein jawab deserve hi nahi karti.",
