    "id": "post:clseed:15:29",
    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Public mein taarif. Private mein crash",
    "body": "Sabke saamne main energy se bhara tha. Ghar aake, phone side rakhte hi, kuch nahi bacha.\n\nDoosron ke liye sab kar dena \u2014 khud ko bhool ke \u2014 aur achha dikhna taaki safe rahoon: maine yeh dono ek saath kiye. Bahar function karo, ghar aake collapse.\n\nYeh kamzori nahi \u2014 yeh ek lambe waqt se chala aa raha pattern hai.",
