    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Unread message dekha \u2014 aur stomach already sink kar gaya",
    "body": "Maine notification dekhi. Message abhi khola tak nahi \u2014 aur mera pet pehle hi gir gaya.\n\nDikkat message mein nahi thi. Dikkat woh gap tha jahan jo main jaanta hoon woh andar tak utra nahi.\n\nMujhe pata hai aaram ka haq hai \u2014 par body abhi bhi on-call khadi rehti hai, jaise chhutti mili hi na ho.",
