    "kind": "post",
    "title": "\"Logistics nahi bane\" matlab opportunity nahi gayi \u2014 maine jaane nahi diya",
    "body": "Woh mauka \"logistics ki wajah se\" nahi gaya.\n\nMaine use jaane diya. Reject hone ke darr ne logistics ko ek bahaane ka kapda pehna diya.\n\n\"Logistics nahi bane\" \u2014 yeh mera sabse aaram waala jhooth tha.",
