    "body": "'Arre main toh paagal hoon \u2014 mujhe neend ki zaroorat hi nahi.'\n\nYeh aaram pe guilt nahi tha. Maine apni zaroorat ko kabhi seriously lena seekha hi nahi \u2014 toh use mazaak bana dena aasaan tha.\n\nNeend toh aati thi \u2014 bas ijaazat nahi thi.",
