    "title": "Chehra calm tha, haath paseene se bheege the",
    "body": "Chehra calm rakhna maine seekh liya. Andar mere haath paseene se bheege hote \u2014 phone haath mein hilta hua \u2014 par bahar sab shaant.\n\nBody ko abhi bhi nahi pata tha ki ab koi khatra nahi.\n\nChehra update ho gaya \u2014 body abhi reh gayi.",
