    "body": "Mujhe sach pata chala. Par sach jaanna aur sach ke saath peace banana \u2014 yeh ek step nahi hai.\n\nBeech mein grief hoti hai. Aur woh grief meri weakness nahi thi \u2014 woh meri honesty ki cost thi.\n\nSach jaana, aur grief bhi aayi \u2014 dono sahi the.",
