    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Soft voice mein chhupa control \u2014 sweetness nahi",
    "body": "Jo bahut soft bolte hain, baar baar poochhte rehte hain \u2014 kuch mein yeh sachcha hota hai.\n\nMaine bhi kabhi yeh contract chalaya tha: 'main itna meetha rahoonga ki tum mujhe chhod hi na sako.' Yeh sweetness nahi \u2014 yeh ek performance hai, narm packaging mein lipti.",
