    "title": "Calendar dekha \u2014 aur thak gaye",
    "body": "Abhi kuch kiya bhi nahi tha. Sirf calendar dekha. Aur phir bhi thak gaye.\n\nMaine bhi mehsoos kiya hai \u2014 kaam ne nahi, kaam ke khayal ne thakaya. Andar se ek awaaz: 'sab ke saamne theek dikhna hai.'",
