    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Course page pe darr laga \u2014 yeh mera purana threat map hai",
    "body": "Course page khula, aur mere andar ek darr utha. Woh darr price se nahi tha.\n\nWoh ek purana threat map tha \u2014 jo dheere se keh raha tha, 'khud par paisa mat lagao.'\n\nMaine woh awaaz kai baar suni hai. Woh meri nahi hai \u2014 woh us waqt ki hai jab khud par kuch bhi lagana kisi ne galat samjhaya tha.",
