    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Meeting se pehle main exit dhoondhne laga",
    "body": "Meeting se theek pehle mera dimaag bahane dhoondhne laga. 'Thoda aur paani pee loon,' 'pehle yeh ek message kar doon.'\n\nWoh laziness nahi thi \u2014 woh mera ek hissa tha jo pehle hi tay kar chuka tha: wahan jaana safe nahi.\n\nExit dhoondhna tab shuru hota hai jab andar koi keh de \u2014 ruk jaao, yeh kamra khatre wala hai.",
