    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Washroom mein do pal saans rokna \u2014 woh break nahi tha",
    "body": "Kai baar main washroom mein jaake do pal saans rok ke khada ho jaata \u2014 koi kaam nahi, bas darwaza band.\n\nWoh break nahi tha. Woh doori ka behroopiya tha. Andar koi keh raha hota \u2014 'bas thodi der, koi mujhe na dekhe.'\n\nJab tak main khud se nahi mila, tab tak doosron ki nazar se chhupna hi mera rest tha.",
