    "title": "Journal mein wahi ek line \u2014 woh progress nahi, loop hai",
    "body": "Ek din maine apni purani diary uthayi aur dekha \u2014 saal bhar pehle bhi main theek yahi line likh raha tha. Shabd wahi, dard wahi.\n\nTab ek sawaal khud se poochha: 'main samajhna kab shuru karoonga \u2014 aur sirf express karte rehna kab band?'\n\nLikhna dard halka kar deta hai. Par dard ka halka hona uska hal jaana nahi hai.",
