    "body": "Chhutti ke din bhi main kaam dhoondh leta hoon. Laptop band hai, par haath khujli karta hai kuch karne ko.\n\nYeh laziness ka ulta nahi hai. Yeh ishaara hai ki aaram mujhe abhi bhi mehfooz nahi lagta.\n\nKahin seekha gaya tha \u2014 ruko toh kuch chhoot jaayega. Body aaj bhi wahi maan ke baithi hai.",
