    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Apni jeet chhupana koi modesty nahi",
    "body": "Main apni chhoti jeet doosron ke saamne minimize kar deta tha \u2014 'arre kuch khaas nahi.' Ise main sanskaar samajhta tha.\n\nWoh humility nahi thi. Woh ek darr tha \u2014 ki koi dekh ke judge karega, isliye pehle hi khud ko chhota kar do.\n\nJeet ko chhupana tehzeeb nahi hoti. Kabhi kabhi woh sirf pehra hota hai.",
