    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Views refresh karna \u2014 woh validation check nahi tha",
    "body": "Post daalne ke baad main baar baar views refresh karta tha. Main samajhta tha yeh curiosity hai.\n\nWoh curiosity nahi thi. Woh body ka ek chhota shortcut tha, ek pal sharm se nikalne ka. Number badha \u2014 seene mein ek second ki raahat. Number ruka \u2014 wahi khaalipan wapas.\n\nUngli refresh karti rehti hai \u2014 par jo main dhoondh raha tha, woh us number mein hai hi nahi.",
