    "body": "Quote save kiya. Star kiya. Screenshot bhi le liya. Main bhi yehi karta tha \u2014 phone bhar gaya inspiration se, aur andar sab wahi ka wahi.\n\nQuote ka kaam tumhe badalna nahi hai. Us darr ka kaam tumhe wahin roke rakhna hai.\n\nSave karna badlaav nahi \u2014 woh ek aur tareeka hai wahin tehre rehne ka.",
