    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Deadline miss ki aur disappear ho gaye \u2014 yeh avoidance nahi",
    "body": "Deadline miss hui aur tum gayab ho gaye. Na reply, na call \u2014 jaise wajood hi mita liya ho. Main bhi phone ulta karke rakh deta tha.\n\nYeh cowardice nahi hai. Yeh ek purana alarm hai \u2014 'agar dikha toh saza milegi.'\n\nKabhi kisi galti pe itni daant padi thi ki chhup jaana hi sabse safe lagne laga.",
