    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Date ke baad silence \u2014 control nahi, integration gap",
    "body": "Ek achhi date ke baad khud ko peeche kheench lena \u2014 yeh control nahi hai. Main bhi kareeb aate hi phone door rakh deta tha.\n\nYeh woh pal hai jab nearness sach ban jaati hai, aur tumhare system ko samajh nahi aata \u2014 ise safe rakhna hai ya isse bhaag jaana.\n\nWoh withdrawal control nahi tha \u2014 woh dar tha, kareeb aane ka.",
