    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Maa ka missed call dekh ke jo hua \u2014 wo loyalty contract tha",
    "body": "Maa ka missed call screen pe dikha, aur seene mein ek kasaav aa gaya. Mera bhi phone haath mein, dil tez, ek awaaz andar \u2014 'abhi call karna padega.'\n\nWoh guilt nahi thi. Woh ek anlikha vaada tha \u2014 'main hamesha turant haazir rahunga, warna main bura beta hoon.'\n\nWoh kasaav tumhara pyaar nahi \u2014 woh ek shart hai jo kisi ne kabhi tumse poochi bhi nahi thi.",
