    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Busy rehna self-care nahi, jab woh dard se bachne ka tarika ho",
    "body": "Raat ko kaam khatam hota hai, aur andar ek ajeeb bechaini uthti hai. Toh main phir ek aur tab khol leta hoon. Phir ek aur.\n\nWoh busyness self-care nahi. Woh kawach hai \u2014 banta hai jab ruk jaana tumhe seedha us dard ke saamne khada kar deta hai.\n\nIsliye tum rukte nahi \u2014 ruk jaane mein woh dikhta hai jisse baach rahe ho.",
