    "kind": "post",
    "title": "10k pe jo khushi thi, 1 million pe nahi aayi",
    "body": "Sabse badi khushi mujhe 10,000 readers pe hui thi. Laga koi sach mein padh raha hai. Phir number badhte gaye \u2014 1 lakh, phir 1 million. Aur woh pehli wali khushi laut ke kabhi nahi aayi. Har naya number pichle se bada tha, magar khaali. Tab samjha \u2014 main logon se juda tha jab woh 10,000 the, aur ginti se juda ho gaya jab woh million ho gaye. Numbers badhte gaye, main mehsoos karna bhool gaya.",
