    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Kho jao toh Banaras chale jaana",
    "body": "Main Banaras mein bada hua. Ek chhota ghar, tang mohalla, subah ki ghanti aur ghaat ki shaam. Bachpan mein laga yahan se bhaagna hai, kuch bada banna hai. NIT gaya, Deloitte gaya, sheher badle. Aur jab sab bikhra, jab kahin jagah nahi lagi \u2014 main phir Assi ke ghaat pe ja baitha. Ganga wahi thi, main badal chuka tha. Us din samjha: main sheher se nahi, khud se bhaag raha tha. Jaha se shuru hue the, wahi wapsi ka raasta tha.",
