    "title": "Dream company chhut gayi, main bach gaya",
    "body": "Deloitte meri dream company thi. Sabko lagta tha main set ho gaya. Andar se main har roz mar raha tha. Corona aaya, aur mujhe nikaal diya gaya. Jo kursi maine khud chhodni thi, woh mujhse cheen li gayi \u2014 aur pehle mujhe laga ye meri sabse badi haar hai. Mahino baad samjha ye meri sabse badi bachat thi. Kabhi kabhi zindagi woh darwaza band karti hai jo tum khud dar ke maare band nahi kar paate.",
