    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Sabko main pasand tha, jaanta koi nahi",
    "body": "Kai saal main ek ajeeb akelepan mein raha. Bheed thi, log the, tareef thi \u2014 phir bhi laga main ek katora paani hoon. Log aate, apni pyaas bujhate, aur chale jaate. Peeche main khaali reh jaata. Sabko main achha lagta tha, par mujhe koi jaanta nahi tha. Phir Pranjali aayi. Aur pehli baar kisi ne mujhe jaana \u2014 pehle jaana, phir pasand kiya. Tab samjha akela hona bura nahi, adekha reh jaana bura hai.",
