    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Ek follower ne kaha, isne meri jaan bacha li",
    "body": "Ek din ek follower ne message kiya ki woh sab khatam karne wala tha, par meri baat ne use rok liya. Us din mujhe laga jo maine bhogaa, woh bekaar nahi gaya. Aham Brahmasmi maine isi liye banayi \u2014 taaki jo andhera main akela paar kiya, koi aur usme akela na rahe. Ye course koi seedhi motivation nahi. Ye woh samajh hai jo mujhe teen saal aur 450 kitaabon ke baad mili. Agar aapke andar bhi woh khaali sawaal baithe hain \u2014 main aapko ek haath dena chahta hoon. Bina jaldi, bina dabaav.",
