    "kind": "post",
    "title": "Main koi guru nahi, ek zinda misaal hoon",
    "body": "Main aapko upar se gyaan nahi dena chahta. Main bas apni kahani rakh raha hoon \u2014 topper se toota hua, phir teen saal ekaant, phir dobara khada. Aham Brahmasmi koi lecture ki dukaan nahi. Woh mera jeeya hua raasta hai, lesson mein badla hua. Main aapke saath khada hoon, aapke upar nahi. Agar aapko lagta hai aapke andar bhi ek adekha, ateet mein atka hua Tushar baitha hai \u2014 toh chalo, use saath mein samajhte hain. Jaldi kuch nahi. Bas jab dil kahe.",
