    "kind": "reel",
    "title": "R3 - Maine Zindagi Mein Sirf Do Baar Maanga",
    "body": "Jo asal prem hota hai na, usme swaarth ki jitni bhi sambhaavnaayein hoti hain \u2014 woh sab khatam ho jaati hain.\n\nUsmein yeh hisaab nahi hota ki koi aayega ya nahi, koi mujhmein interest lega ya nahi. Asli prem maangta nahi. Woh bas hota hai, bina kisi shart ke.",
