    "title": "R4 - Vish Bhi Piyo, Par Had Jaano",
    "body": "Ek baar koi mujhse debate kar raha tha. Usne kaha ki are woh toh alag cheezein hain.\n\nMaine usse kaha \u2014 main spirituality aur materialism ko alag-alag maanta hi nahi hoon. Mere liye yeh do dushman nahi hain. Vish bhi piyo agar zaroorat ho, par apni had jaano. Sab kuch ek hi reality ka hissa hai.",
